# Legacy AshNeo4j Livebook path

This repository is now documented as **AshR2RML**, a generic Ash-to-R2RML semantic mapping extension.

AshR2RML is not an `Ash.DataLayer` and does not require Neo4j, Bolty, or Cypher.

The canonical runnable guide is `ash_r2rml.livemd`.

This donor-era filename remains temporarily so old documentation/package links fail informatively rather than presenting obsolete graph-database instructions.
